{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6e39aa9dc5a833d9b01","chatId":"d87afd8f591349879700c0834dfaa992","sessionId":null,"userId":99386,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"C\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":5407,"promptTokens":517,"completionTokens":107,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:45:39"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004606892830884861,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6e39aa9dc5a833d9b00","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483939158,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:45:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a6e39aa9dc5a833d9b00","chatId":"d87afd8f591349879700c0834dfaa992","sessionId":null,"userId":99386,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n妈妈在出门买菜前让我洗衣服，我也答应了。但她走了以后我又懒得做。毫无察觉时，妈妈突然在楼下叫我，我下楼时意识到我有麻烦了。她问我我洗没洗衣服，我心虚地避开她的目光，嘴上却说做了。等妈妈做饭时，我立马冲上楼洗衣服。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 紧张 & 信任\nB) 尴尬 & 信任\nC) 紧张 & 尴尬\nD) 尴尬 & 自豪\nE) 紧张 & 自豪\nF) 尴尬 & 爱护\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我忘了做妈妈让我做的事 & 我不应该同意去洗衣服\nB) 我忘了做妈妈让我做的事 & 我对妈妈撒谎说洗了衣服\nC) 我对妈妈撒谎说洗了衣服 & 我不希望我的妈妈不断提醒我做家务\nD) 我不应该同意去洗衣服 & 我已经决定了晚餐要做什么\nE) 我不应该同意去洗衣服 & 我不希望我的妈妈不断提醒我做家务\nF) 我忘了做妈妈让我做的事 & 我对去购买杂货感到紧张","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004606892830884861,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a6e39aa9dc5a833d9b01","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794483939156,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:45:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"197649b3e50d4bb08ada9076b7b84787"}